WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
Open AI Assistant and describe the incident in the message box.

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:08.080
Say which microphone failed, where it happened, and what you heard.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.350
Send the report.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.600
Iris suggests a classification, but you can correct it.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:18.000
For this equipment repair, choose Repair and Maintenance and the audio malfunction subcategory.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.390
Check the studio, pick the room, and record the device and the symptom.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:30.110
Answer the marked questions about affected classes, when the problem started, the condition of the equipment, and its impact on members.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:33.720
When the required answers are complete, choose Review ticket.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.850
Read the draft before selecting Approve and create.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.370
The confirmation now has a ticket number.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.090
Open ticket to check the saved record, then reload the page.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:45.430
The same number and issue are still there.
